&lt;span class="code-grey"&gt;b2,a,msb,xy ..&lt;/span&gt; file: &lt;span class="code-dark-yellow"&gt;Matlab v4 mat-file (little endian) | &amp;lt;?, numeric, rows 0, columns 0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="code-grey"&gt;b3,r,lsb,xy ..&lt;/span&gt; file: &lt;span class="code-dark-yellow"&gt;gfxboot compiled html help file&lt;/span&gt;
