&lt;span class="code-grey"&gt;b4,bgr,lsb,xy ..&lt;/span&gt; file: &lt;span class="code-dark-yellow"&gt;Targa image data - Map 273 x 272 x 16 +1 +4113 - 1-bit alpha ""&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="code-grey"&gt;b4,rgba,lsb,xy ..&lt;/span&gt; file: &lt;span class="code-dark-yellow"&gt;Novell LANalyzer capture file&lt;/span&gt;
